// capri-tree: 1
// id: settings-panel
// name: Settings panel
// author: Capri
// version: 1.0.0
// description: A panel on her Settings page, written as a tree. Copy it, give it your own id and file name, and change the rows.
//
// The first line under the header names the page: settings.
// A line with one dash is a panel: its heading on her Settings page.
// Two dashes is a row in it: its name, her piece in [brackets], and what it reaches in (round brackets).
//   [switch]       her OFF / ON pair. (setting: wander) is one of hers by name; any other name is this mod's own value.
//   [slider]       her slider, on the steps of one of her settings: (setting: size).
//   [buttonLarge]  a key the panel's width; [buttonSmall] the right half. (command: preview voice) runs one of hers.
//   [buttonRow]    keys side by side: each key is a line under it, three dashes.
// Commands are hers only: preview voice, refresh providers. Nothing that deletes, uninstalls, updates, sends online or
// opens a file picker. A line she can't read is left out, with a line in her log naming this mod.
settings
-MY PANEL
--Wander [switch] (setting: wander)
--My own switch [switch] (setting: my own switch)
--Size [slider] (setting: size)
--Hear her voice [buttonLarge] (command: preview voice)
--Keys [buttonRow]
---Hear her [buttonSmall] (command: preview voice)
---Refresh providers [buttonSmall] (command: refresh providers)
